  "editorial": {
    "name": "Colir",
    "descriptionZh": "Colir 是一个网页版渐变生成器，用两条 X/Y 曲线控制颜色在画布上的走向，再叠噪声、羽毛、闪光等效果，最后导出 PNG 或 WebP。",
    "takeawayZh": "拖两条曲线捏渐变，导出 PNG 或分享链接",
    "noteZh": "深色首屏正中是 Gradients that don't look like defaults 大标题，下面一句 Curve-based gradients. Effects. No banding. 和一枚 Start Creating Now 按钮；顶栏右侧依次是 Process、Features、Examples、FAQ、Pricing、Figma Plugin、Login 与黑色的 Launch App。页面底部压着 cookie 声明条，写着只用必要 cookie。正文把 How it Works 拆成 Pick Colors、Adjust Curves、Add Filters、Export 四步，Features 一节用 timeline / speed / layers / auto_fix_high / download / palette 六组图标分别讲 X/Y curve control、GPU-accelerated WebGL 实时渲染、12 blend modes、噪声/闪光/羽毛/畸变四种特效、1×–4× 的 PNG/WebP 导出与 9 built-in palettes，另有一块 Made in Colir 作品区，每件配 Edit in Colir 链接。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Freemium",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
